### F1 - Get existing product: expect 200 with JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Get unknown product: expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/999
Accept: application/json

### F1 - Set invalid product: expect 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/abc
Accept: application/json